    "summary": "The post Who Won The Midterms 2026? Democrats Win House As Senate Race Goes Down To The Wire appeared first on Coinpedia Fintech News\nDemocrats are projected to win control of the US House of Representatives after strong results in Tuesday’s midterm elections, the BBC reported. With 247 of 435 House seats counted, Democrats had won 152 and Republicans 95, according to the BBC’s tally. In the Senate, Democrats held 50 seats, including those not up for election, against …",
