    "summary": "The Dubai Fintech Summit closed its second day at Madinat Jumeirah on Tuesday with DIFC marking a milestone it set itself less than ten years ago. The centre is now home to more than 2,000 AI, fintech and innovation firms\nThe post Dubai Fintech Summit day two: 2,000 firms, a Japanese bridge and AI moves into production appeared first on The Fintech Times.",
    "hasSummary": true,
